   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Describe the video or the thumbnail you want, and type the words to show on it (exactly as they should appear; leave empty for none). Queue.\n\n'Enhance' writes a detailed thumbnail prompt first (Qwen3-4B): a bold focal subject, high contrast, the text big and clear of faces. Your words always appear as typed.\n\nTo put your own face on the main person, turn 'Use my face' on and load a photo.\nWith several faces it asks which one to replace.\nSaved in outputs/comfyui/thumbnails, each in its own folder with its prompt (prompt.txt)."
   ],
